REM Preserve Preview Size Toggle Demo
REM Starts in preserve-size mode, then switches to legacy sizing.

LOG "Starting preserve_size toggle demo"

EFFECTPARAM "preserve_size" 1
LOG "preserve_size=1"
EFFECT "Classic CRT"
WAIT 2s
EFFECT "Arcade Cabinet"
WAIT 2s

EFFECTPARAM "preserve_size" 0
LOG "preserve_size=0"
EFFECT "Classic CRT"
WAIT 2s
EFFECT "Arcade Cabinet"
WAIT 2s

LOG "Preserve_size toggle demo completed"
STOP
